# Fork in the Road (WotG 50) in La Vaule [S], the Ronfaure Dawndrop and the six other dawndrops held: blank_fork plays 5
# [85, 23, 1756, 0, 85, 1]; its finish gives the zone's dawndrop (1723, message 6398), says GATHERED_DAWNDROPS_LIGHT
# (8361, the Primal Glow) and RETRACED_ALL_JUNCTIONS (messageName 8362), takes the seven dawndrops (one key item list
# each, in the pairs order Beaucedine, Jugner, San d'Oria, Walk of Echoes, La Vaule, Xarcabard, Throne Room) and the
# Ronfaure Dawndrop, and completes the mission (the Primal Glow, 1731, message 6398; Maiden of the Dusk current).
lists LaVauleS/blank_fork/onTrigger LaVauleS/onEventFinish/5
char zone=LaVauleS pos=296.482,3.497,-217.001 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForkInTheRoad current
keyitem RonfaureDawndrop
keyitem JugnerDawndrop
keyitem SanDoriaDawndrop
keyitem BeaucedineDawndrop
keyitem XarcabardDawndrop
keyitem ThroneRoomDawndrop
keyitem WalkOfEchoesDawndrop
login
trigger blank_fork                         # 5
finish                                     # the seventh dawndrop: the messages, all taken, completed
